# Loading Zone: each replacement effect applies once (CR 614.5), so two Loading Zones make four times as many counters (the ruling). Bot1 casts a Loading Zone and a Grizzly Bears on turn 1 and
# the second Loading Zone on turn 3. On turn 5 it casts a Larval Scoutlander (a Spacecraft, not yet a creature); stationing it with the Bears (power 2) puts 2 x 4 = 8 charge counters on it, enough
# for 7+ (it is a Spacecraft before it is a creature).

